- after committing, `git rev-parse epic/e` must equal `git rev-parse HEAD`;
- if either check fails, return status "blocked" with the reason. Never repair a branch by hand.

If you cannot finish, return status "blocked" with the reason in reason, and send every other required field empty ("" or []). Otherwise return status "done".

Return the commit sha, the files you changed, and a one-line summary (it becomes the PR title).

